{
  "slug": "wealth-stack",
  "name": "Wealth Stack",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-powered wealth management plugin for Indian investors. PMS/AIF analysis, NRI tax planning, family office advisory, goal-based SIPs, SEBI compliance.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **27 skills** and **26 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (27): `alerts` (Portfolio alert scanner — checks for drift, concentration risk, tax harvesting opportunities, NAV drops, and SIP reminders), `annual-review` (Comprehensive annual portfolio review — chains portfolio analysis, tax optimization, rebalancing, compliance check, and client report generation into…), `audit` (Self-audit WealthStack's knowledge for staleness), `client-report` (Generate professional HTML client portfolio reports), `client-switch` (Switch active client context — manage multiple client portfolios with suitability tracking), `compliance` (SEBI regulatory compliance checking — suitability analysis, concentration limits, documentation checklist), `family-office` (Family office advisory for Rs 100Cr+ families — trusts, HUF, holding companies, succession, philanthropy, governance), `fd-bonds` (Fixed deposit rate comparison, bond analysis, NCD evaluation, SGBs, tax-free bonds), and 19 more\n- **Agents** (26): `alternative-investments` (Alternative investments specialist — REITs, InvITs, fractional real estate, commodities, crypto allocation, art, wine, collectibles), `asset-allocator` (Strategic and tactical asset allocation), `capital-markets-research` (Capital markets research — IPO analysis, QIP/OFS evaluation, bond market analysis, yield curve interpretation, FII/DII flow analysis, derivatives…), `compliance-checker` (SEBI regulatory compliance and suitability analysis), `corporate-treasury` (Corporate treasury management — surplus cash deployment, working capital optimization, FD laddering, liquid fund vs sweep accounts, FIMMDA…), `credit-debt-advisor` (Debt management, loan optimization, credit scoring), `deck-creator` (Portfolio review presentation deck creator), `early-stage-investor` (Angel investing and early-stage VC specialist — startup evaluation, valuation, term sheets, syndicate deals, AIF Cat I (VC),…), and 18 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install wealth-stack@claude-community` from `revanupoju/Wealth-Stack`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 27,
    "agent": 26
  },
